# GPPS Procedure tables -- attachment / text-quality analysis
# + interactive JSON viewer
#
# Consolidates: schema discovery, full-record field validation
# (not just a 5-row sample), the "Attachments analysis" output
# in the same column layout as the policy sheet, and a cascading
# country -> procedure_core_id JSON viewer.
#
# Confirmed in the prior run on this table:
#   - version_num loads as Int64 (numeric) -- no string-sort risk
#   - zero (id, version) duplicate pairs -- dedup via
#     groupby(id).tail(1) gives exactly one row per procedure_core_id
#   - main text field  = 'procedureText'
#   - attachment field = 'procedureApplication'
#   - title field      = 'procedureTitle'
# This script re-derives those structurally rather than hard-coding
# them, so it still self-detects correctly if a sibling country
# procedure table turns up with a different shape.
# ============================================================

